    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Project is an indie horror project that will introduce you to the history of the Degeons Intertainment corporations. As the game progresses, you will be able to find notes that will fully describe to you the entire deep history of the largest corporation in this game universe. The main antagonist is the unsuccessful experiment of the Degeons Laboratories companies, called the &quot;Kili project&quot;. You play in the first person of an ordinary guy named Adrian. Your task is not only to find keys and notes, but also to simultaneously trick the AI, whose task is to scare you as much as possible. Explore the location, talk to people who may know something about this company... You also have to dig into your dreams, which are associated with very bad memories.. Explore the office at night, open all the doors and run away from the terrible creature Kili.. Take him next to you..</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Project is an indie horror project that will introduce you to the history of the Degeons Intertainment corporations. As the game progresses, you will be able to find notes that will fully describe to you the entire deep history of the largest corporation in this game universe. The main antagonist is the unsuccessful experiment of the Degeons Laboratories companies, called the &quot;Kili project&quot;. You play in the first person of an ordinary guy named Adrian. Your task is not only to find keys and notes, but also to simultaneously trick the AI, whose task is to scare you as much as possible. Explore the location, talk to people who may know something about this company... You also have to dig into your dreams, which are associated with very bad memories.. Explore the office at night, open all the doors and run away from the terrible creature Kili.. Take him next to you..</p>",
    "short_description": "Indie project in the horror genre, the purpose of which is to solve the big plot of the game universe by searching for notes, talking to people, exploring locations, as well as dreams. The main villain, whose name is &quot;Kili&quot;, will interfere with you.",
